Key Learning Points
	•	Software Installation GPO requires MSI packages.
	•	Always use a UNC path rather than a local drive path.
	•	Computer Configuration policies apply to computers, not users.
	•	Link the GPO to the OU containing the target computer object.
	•	Verify downloaded software before deployment by checking its file type and source.

⸻

Outcome

Successfully deployed software automatically to a domain-joined workstation using Group Policy and resolved deployment issues caused by incorrect GPO linking and downloading an invalid installer.
